[{"sha":"b8d2613ac050aa4aa8bfb2cf28380d81cdfcd1ca","node_id":"C_kwDOQp3VPdoAKGI4ZDI2MTNhYzA1MGFhNGFhOGJmYjJjZjI4MzgwZDgxY2RmY2QxY2E","commit":{"author":{"name":"Jonathan Hefner","email":"jonathan@hefner.pro","date":"2026-04-19T20:08:24Z"},"committer":{"name":"Jonathan Hefner","email":"jonathan@hefner.pro","date":"2026-04-19T20:09:27Z"},"message":"Point \"progressive disclosure\" links at `specification.mdx`\n\nTwo links in `best-practices.mdx` and `optimizing-descriptions.mdx`\npointed at `/what-are-skills#how-skills-work`, blocking the eventual\nremoval of `what-are-skills.mdx`. Redirect them to the existing\n`## Progressive disclosure` section in `specification.mdx`, which is a\nmore natural reference target for the concept.\n\nAlso expand that section's lead-in from \"Skills should be structured for\nefficient use of context:\" to a sentence that names progressive\ndisclosure as a loading mechanism, so readers who follow the link land\non a definition rather than a bare set of structural guidelines. The\noriginal three-level list and `SKILL.md` line-count guidance are\npreserved unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e1648f8cc24b8f3d892e3477f872942f66f78c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentskills/agentskills/git/trees/1e1648f8cc24b8f3d892e3477f872942f66f78c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agentskills/agentskills/git/commits/b8d2613ac050aa4aa8bfb2cf28380d81cdfcd1ca","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEh/+OGbyzfRKdx76XDaQK/SEENpEFAmnlNn4ACgkQDaQK/SEE\nNpFwtg//YZL+mLlaluQed3xMlmoVjPOk0nMQ3X7Xvf1u6gWcHTRGDBhDs3rGA4kL\ng7F4/D0fneXBDIOJ0eitoHj2Intub+TcXqrWgOwF5kP34k4JwPcfthjRnvSxE3Tn\nP+wOG5nquOgNQWKQLBdXaVJN+/1qQP+OD6kgxciRGC21ChPySmnAvaYqu/4L3fiy\nfcgrProEnxEMO6wTZMSPztp1pVgpLf0OThefTGJZ5Keyb9T5L3x7IPUIsTOhpHnw\no2vFZMXiSlTwYRdGkQd2J2gySzFhropfsyUxJpmYvnaIfL511I9WQ+rKY/0QAMDs\nmNzg5JXfiKMWy1IuztDZuXHA